        <p style="text-indent: 7em" rend="first-line-indent(7)" source="#source-20123-20195"><hi rend="italic" source="#source-20144-20182" corresp="#source-20151-20182"><seg source="#source-20144-20151">through</seg></hi><seg source="#source-20182-20195"> the door, </seg></p>
